oundaries within maximum plus/minus two fitted sigma. Theoretical transport coverage is not confidence coverage or FWHM.\",\r\n          \"observed_period\": null,\r\n          \"calendar_months\": null,\r\n          \"fixed_layer_bounds_m\": null,\r\n          \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n          \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n          \"rank_eligible\": false,\r\n          \"annual_extrema_eligible\": false,\r\n          \"seasonal_playback_eligible\": false,\r\n          \"full_width_inference_eligible\": false,\r\n          \"source_url\": \"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1029/2019GL084723\",\r\n          \"source_citation\": \"Bosse and Fer (2019), Mean Structure and Seasonality of the Norwegian Atlantic Front Current Along the Mohn Ridge From Repeated Glider Transects, doi:10.1029/2019GL084723; corrected 2020-09-28.\",\r\n          \"source_locator\": \"Corrected publisher HTML: sections 2.2-2.4, 3.1-3.2 and erratum.\",\r\n          \"source_access\": \"Corrected publisher text reviewed. Corrected original PDF and supporting Table S1 not acquired; raw-mission source QA is not paper reproduction.\",\r\n          \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-13\",\r\n          \"source_correction_date\": \"2020-09-28\",\r\n          \"source_publication_year\": 2019,\r\n          \"sampling_context\": {\r\n            \"glider_context_months\": {\r\n              \"start\": \"2016-06\",\r\n              \"end\": \"2017-07\"\r\n            },\r\n            \"glider_sections\": 25,\r\n            \"study_interval_is_exact_width_occupation_dates\": false,\r\n            \"seasonal_composite_months\": {\r\n              \"winter\": [\r\n                1,\r\n                2,\r\n                3,\r\n                4\r\n              ],\r\n              \"summer\": [\r\n                5,\r\n                6,\r\n                7,\r\n                8\r\n              ],\r\n              \"fall\": [\r\n                9,\r\n             