ing NGCIC after discussion of 300–800 m reversing flow; Data and Method describes two moorings.\",\r\n          \"supports\": \"Source names an intermediate reversing flow separately from NGCC and NGCUC; geographic endpoints and transverse boundaries not supplied here.\",\r\n          \"source_access\": \"Relevant publisher text read; fields and figures not digitized.\"\r\n        }\r\n      ],\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Review name admission and vertical overlap with the NGCUC.\",\r\n        \"Recover intermediate-layer spatial support and dated axes before dimensions.\",\r\n        \"Keep surface seasonal symbols and undercurrent route separate from this proposed identity.\"\r\n      ]\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"proposed_id\": \"aleutian-north-slope\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Aleutian North Slope Current\",\r\n      \"basin\": \"Bering Sea\",\r\n      \"proposed_kind\": \"pass-fed island-slope current\",\r\n      \"identity_scope\": \"Bering-side flow distinct from the Aleutian/Subarctic Current and Alaskan Stream; pass exchanges interrupt continuity.\",\r\n      \"inventory_decision\": \"missing_from_current_name_ledger\",\r\n      \"length_decision\": \"resolve_pass_exchange_and_layer_before_route_measurement\",\r\n      \"whole_current_length_km\": null,\r\n      \"rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"evidence\": [\r\n        {\r\n          \"url\": \"https://www.pmel.noaa.gov/pubs/outstand/stab1878/stab1878.shtml\",\r\n          \"citation\": \"Stabeno, Schumacher and Ohtani (1999), The physical oceanography of the Bering Sea, Dynamics of the Bering Sea, pp. 1–28.\",\r\n          \"locator\": \"Mean Upper Ocean Circulation: Aleutian North Slope Current.\",\r\n          \"supports\": \"Regional support at 174–167 W; roughly 20 km author-described width belongs to ANSC, not Aleutian. Neither supplies whole-current endpoints.\",\r\n          \"source_access\": \"Relevant HTML circulation subsections and captions read; underlying surveys and figure