on license. Original factual summaries and OSW diagram only.\",\r\n        \"figure_file\": \"figures/southern-east-madagascar-reported-dimensions.svg\",\r\n        \"reported_length_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n        \"physical_annual_width_range_km\": null,\r\n        \"geographic_current_edges\": null,\r\n        \"seasonal_playback_eligible\": false,\r\n        \"records\": [\r\n          {\r\n            \"id\": \"southern-east-madagascar-nauw2008-reported-extent\",\r\n            \"dimension\": \"length\",\r\n            \"value_km\": 650,\r\n            \"approximate\": true,\r\n            \"metric\": \"author_reported_southern_branch_extent\",\r\n            \"source_locator\": \"Introduction paragraph2\",\r\n            \"support\": \"Southward branch from approximately20S to Cap Sainte Marie at approximately25deg30minS. Source cites Duncan1970 and Lutjeharms1988b; this is a contextual literature estimate, not a new length measured by the2001 cruise.\",\r\n            \"observed_period\": null,\r\n            \"fixed_layer_bounds_m\": null,\r\n            \"endpoint_coordinates_lon_lat\": null,\r\n            \"uncertainty_km\": null,\r\n            \"is_annual_mean\": false,\r\n            \"is_annual_extremum\": false,\r\n            \"rank_eligible\": false\r\n          },\r\n          {\r\n            \"id\": \"southern-east-madagascar-nauw2008-survey-width\",\r\n            \"dimension\": \"width\",\r\n            \"value_km\": 120,\r\n            \"approximate\": true,\r\n            \"metric\": \"author_reported_near_surface_survey_width\",\r\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results3.1 paragraph17; abstract\",\r\n            \"support\": \"SectionsT5–T8 in April2001 off southeast Madagascar. Near-surface current structure uses VMADCP mean velocity in the upper100m. Numeric edge cutoff, boundary coordinates and width uncertainty are not specified in this passage.\",\r\n            \"observed_period\": \"2001-04\",\r\n            \"fixed_layer_bounds_m\": null,\r\n            \"velocity_averaging_layer_m\": [\r\n              0,\r\n              100\r\n            ],\r\n            \"velocity_averaging_layer_is_verified_width_layer\": false,\r\n            \"endpoint_coordinates_lon_lat\": null,\r\n            \"uncertainty_km\": null,\r\n            \"is_annual_mean\": false,\r\n            \"is_annual_extremum\": false,\r\n            \"rank_eligible\": false\r\n          }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"interpretation\": \"Separate source-reported dimensions, not the sides of a current footprint. April2001 width and contextual branch length must not be multiplied into an area. No seasonal range, dated axis, fixed width layer or annual mean inferred.\"\r\n      },\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Review southern branch identity and naming against northern branch, undercurrent and countercurrent before canonical admission.\",\r\n        \"Acquire original PDF and visually review source figures; retain the distinction between primary survey width and cited contextual length.\",\r\n        \"Recover explicit velocity boundaries and repeat occupations before annual width or seasonal map construction.\",\r\n        \"Integrate reviewed identity into canonical names, taxonomy, release, atlas and source-backed state joins; no Agulhas geometry inherited.\"\r\n      ]\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n"},"research/ocean-current-reference-route-state-join.json":{"source_sha256":"0a46e99e2baade6512cb7781f6bdef389dbb28d238440791ba13aa79e23238b8","source_json":"{\r\n  \"schema\": \"osw.current-reference-route-state-join.v1\",\r\n  \"status\": \"editorial_route_display_crossings_not_physical_passage\",\r\n  \"method\": \"Invert stored nominal and all declared scenario crossings of the approximate OSW display-state shapes. No velocity, width, footprint, residence or transport is diagnosed.\",\r\n  \"scenario_count_meaning\": \"Counts within an editorial sensitivity grid; not probabilities, dated frequency, confidence or seasonal occupancy.\",\r\n  \"absence_meaning\": \"No candidate crossing recorded; physical current passage remains unresolved.\",\r\n  \"counts\": {\r\n    \"states\": 56,\r\n    \"route_candidates\": 76,\r\n    \"currents_with_route_candidates\": 70,\r\n    \"states_with_candidate_crossings\": 49,\r\n    \"candidate_state_pairs\": 150\r\n  },\r\n  \"excluded_display_contacts\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"candidate_id\": \"black-sea-rim-reference-path-candidate\",\r\n      \"state_code\": \"MEDI\",\r\n      \"reason\": \"Black Sea basin circuit is geographically distinct; raw contact is with a coarse display-region extension, not membership in this named state.\",\r\n      \"nominal_crossing\": true,\r\n      \"crossing_scenario_count\": 9,\r\n      \"scenario_count\": 9,\r\n      \"crosses_in_all_declared_scenarios\": true\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"candidate_id\": \"black-sea-rim-reference-path-candidate\",\r\n      \"state_code\": \"REDS\",\r\n      \"reason\": \"Black Sea basin circuit is geographically distinct; raw contact is with a coarse display-region extension, not membership in this named state.\",\r\n      \"nominal_crossing\": false,\r\n      \"crossing_scenario_count\": 4,\r\n      \"scenario_count\": 9,\r\n      \"crosses_in_all_declared_scenarios\": false\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"input_sha256\": {\r\n    \"research/ocean-current-reference-path-candidates.json\": \"b06caed27655c39f8127ddda441cba0a856800f599ec52edcd5b30d2ad37b633\",\r\n    \"research/ocean-motion-state-join.json\": \"c7a49187e74ac9959f18b23cf5ecaa826c017eacb8e387f2bf6e8605b6ab65f9\",\r\n    \"research/indian-seuc-mam-reach-reference-path-candidate.json\": \"09e20729d63ef0930ba1835f95fdc24285726de590f4d2c9915604358867c117\",\r\n    \"research/pacific-necc-reach-reference-path-candidate.json\": \"0df217ce291f5e8d4804a2fa25f86a2bb8a6fdd5101f00abe2401583ec00df01\",\r\n    \"research/pacific-nscc-reach-reference-path-candidate.json\": \"0afb68c180bb6a8528173974c6a88641f1f0a22ddc1db5683ee1f95c6876