tory or climatological current axis.\",\r\n  \"source_url\": \"https://www.tidesandcurrents.noaa.gov/glossary.html\",\r\n  \"source_locator\": \"North Atlantic Current entry: start near 40 degrees N, 50 degrees W, continuation toward British Isles, membership of Gulf Stream System and onward Norwegian/Canary flows.\",\r\n  \"source_citation\": \"NOAA Center for Operational Oceanographic Products and Services, Tides and Currents Glossary, North Atlantic Current entry (accessed 2026-10-02).\",\r\n  \"source_license\": \"Factual regional geography only; no source map, curve, provider geometry or velocity field packaged.\",\r\n  \"coordinate_selection\": \"NOAA supplies a broad start and British Isles destination; OSW selects all intermediate vertices and exact approach gates. Alternatives are regional terminal conventions, not observed northern/southern current branches. No single reconstructed axis or universal termination is implied.\",\r\n  \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n    [\r\n      -50,\r\n      40\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      -45,\r\n      45\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      -35,\r\n      48\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      -25,\r\n      50\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      -15,\r\n      52\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      -12,\r\n      53\r\n    ]\r\n  ],\r\n  \"alternative_routes\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"southern_british_approach\",\r\n      \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n        [\r\n          -50,\r\n          40\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -45,\r\n          45\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -35,\r\n          48\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -25,\r\n          50\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -15,\r\n          50\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -11,\r\n          50\r\n        ]\r\n      ],\r\n      \"interpretation\": \"OSW southern British Isles approach convention; not a measured branch centerline.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"northern_british_approach\",\r\n      \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n        [\r\n          -50,\r\n          40\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -45,\r\n          45\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -35,\r\n          48\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -25,\r\n          52\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -18,\r\n          55\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          -12,\r\n          57\r\n        ]\r\n      ],\r\n      \"interpretation\": \"OSW northern British Isles approach convention; not an observed branch or onward Norwegian Current extent.\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"scenario_rule\": \"Three regional terminal-route conventions crossed with three longitude offsets (-0.5/0/+0.5 degrees) and independent endpoint latitude offsets (-0.5/0/+0.5 degrees): 81 editorial scenarios. Latitude/longitude offsets do not represent empirical positional uncertainty or include all meanders and branches.\",\r\n  \"longitude_offsets_degrees\": [\r\n    -0.5,\r\n    0,\r\n    0.5\r\n  ],\r\n  \"endpoint_latitude_offsets_degrees\": [\r\n    -0.5,\r\n    0,\r\n    0.5\r\n  ],\r\n  \"report_rounding_km\": 100,\r\n  \"rank_eligible_published_estimates\": false,\r\n  \"candidate_comparison_group\": \"osw_approximate_reference_routes\",\r\n  \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n    \"Independent oceanographic review of naming limits, Grand Banks region and British Isles approach-route alternatives.\",\r\n    \"Validate intermediate geography against reproducible upper-ocean velocity/front geometry and account for omitted meanders.\",\r\n    \"Canonical admission and publication review; preserve distinction from the full Gulf Stream System.\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"map_view_box\": [\r\n    560,\r\n    170,\r\n    230,\r\n    200\r\n  ],\r\n  \"endpoint_labels\": [\r\n    \"40°N, 50°W region\",\r\n    \"West of Ireland gate\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"figure_source_label\": \"NOAA currents glossary\",\r\n  \"route_extent_kind\": \"NOAA North Atlantic regional route\",\r\n  \"whole_system_length\": false,\r\n  \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-02\",\r\n  \"input_sha256\": \"92