w-guinea-coastal-surface-reach-reference-path-input.json\",\r\n  \"figure\": \"figures/new-guinea-coastal-surface-reach-reference-path-candidate.svg\"\r\n}\r\n"},"research/balearic-reference-path-candidate.json":{"source_sha256":"52d27b7b19c49942626d49973358c7f2d5f428b310d85b9a03dd7ced1c464299","source_json":"{\r\n  \"status\": \"editorial_reference_path_candidate_not_scientifically_reviewed\",\r\n  \"geometry_role\": \"osw_editorial_reference_route\",\r\n  \"crs\": \"OGC:CRS84\",\r\n  \"source_license\": \"Source geography paraphrased with attribution; no source figures, drifter tracks, profiles or velocity data packaged.\",\r\n  \"longitude_offsets_degrees\": [\r\n    -0.05,\r\n    0,\r\n    0.05\r\n  ],\r\n  \"endpoint_latitude_offsets_degrees\": [\r\n    -0.05,\r\n    0,\r\n    0.05\r\n  ],\r\n  \"report_rounding_km\": 100,\r\n  \"rank_eligible_published_estimates\": false,\r\n  \"candidate_comparison_group\": \"osw_approximate_reference_routes\",\r\n  \"whole_system_length\": false,\r\n  \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-03\",\r\n  \"map_label_size\": 0.55,\r\n  \"legend_line_spacing\": 1.2,\r\n  \"map_symbol_scale\": 0.2,\r\n  \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n    \"Review named-flow extent and historical/current regional applicability.\",\r\n    \"Verify shelf/slope and island clearance with suitable bathymetry and velocity fields.\",\r\n    \"Do not equate Northern Current contribution or North Balearic continuation label with an interchangeable alias.\",\r\n    \"Canonical admission and publication review; no seasonal route extrema or width footprint admitted.\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"schema\": \"osw.current-reference-path-input.v1\",\r\n  \"current_id\": \"balearic\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Balearic Current\",\r\n  \"scope\": \"Northern Balearic island-margin corridor from an OSW Ibiza offshore approach to a gate north/northeast of Menorca. Excludes upstream mainland Northern Current, its cyclonic return loop, southward channel flow, Algerian eddies and downstream basin recirculation. No full connected-system length.\",\r\n  \"layer\": \"Upper-layer current along Balearic shelf/slope naming context; no fixed-depth axis reconstructed. June 1989 survey described a roughly 250 m layer, not one width at all depths.\",\r\n  \"time_convention\": \"Regional island-margin reference informed by June 1989 FE-89 observations published in 1996 and 2020 model-comparison context. Not the actual cruise trajectory, annual mean axis, simultaneous observation or route valid through wind-driven reversals.\",\r\n  \"source_url\": \"https://archimer.ifremer.fr/doc/00094/20507/18176.pdf\",\r\n  \"source_locator\": \"Printed page 496 / PDF page 8, Conclusions: flow formed from Ibiza, follows Balearic shelf and leaves basin north of Menorca; printed 495-496 / PDF pages 7-8 describe channel/recirculation contributions and continuity limits.\",\r\n  \"source_citation\": \"Garcia-Ladona, Castellon, Font and Tintore (1996), The Balearic current and volume transports in the Balearic basin, Oceanologica Acta 19(5), 489-497.\",\r\n  \"supporting_sources\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"url\": \"https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/marine-science/articles/10.3389/fmars.2020.00497/full\",\r\n      \"citation\": \"Ramirez-Romero et al. (2020), Assessment of the Skill of Coupled Physical-Biogeochemical Models in the NW Mediterranean, doi:10.3389/fmars.2020.00497.\",\r\n      \"locator\": \"Results, Horizontal Patterns: northeast current north of Balearic islands; NEMO-BFM restricted Mallorca-Menorca extent differs from other models.\",\r\n      \"role\": \"General direction and differing modeled extent; no universal coordinate axis or representative seasonal route.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"url\": \"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1029/2021JC017589\",\r\n      \"citation\": \"Aguiar et al. (2022), Strong Long-Lived Anticyclonic Mesoscale Eddies in the Balearic Sea: Formation, Intensification, and Thermal Impact, doi:10.1029/2021JC017589.\",\r\n      \"locator\": \"Section 2, Study Area, paragraph on Northern Current split near 40.6 N.\",\r\n      \"role\": \"Northern Current branch contributes to Balearic flow; excludes entire upstream turn/loop from this island-margin length.\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"coordinate_selection\": \"Every offshore vertex and gate is OSW-selected. Primary source gives Ibiza-to-north-Menorca shelf geography but no exact named endpoints, coordinates or full length. Alternative Ibiza/Menorca approach gates test extent convention. No source drifter track, hydrographic section or thermal front digitized; scenarios are not current width, seasonal evolution or measured endpoint error. Island-centre context points are approximate OSW orientation markers, not resolved coast outlines or clearance evidence.\",\r\n  \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n    [\r\n      0.7,\r\n      38.95\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      1.05,\r\n      39.18\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      1.65,\r\n      39.38\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      2.15,\r\n      39.72\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      2.55,\r\n      40\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      3.25,\r\n      40.12\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      3.9,\r\n      40.22\r\n    ],\r\n    [\r\n      4.55,\r\n      40.28\r\n    ]\r\n  ],\r\n  \"alternative_routes\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"shorter_ibiza_menorca_approaches\",\r\n      \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n        [\r\n          1,\r\n          39.18\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          1.65,\r\n          39.38\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          2.15,\r\n          39.72\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          2.55,\r\n          40\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          3.25,\r\n          40.12\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          3.9,\r\n          40.22\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          4.2,\r\n          40.25\r\n        ]\r\n      ],\r\n      \"interpretation\": \"OSW shorter offshore gates along the same island-margin corridor; not a Mallorca-only definition or seasonally observed contraction.\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"scenario_rule\": \"Two selected island-margin gate conventions crossed with longitude and independent endpoint latitude offsets -0.05/0/+0.05 degrees: 54 editorial scenarios, not measured width, seasonal change or endpoint uncertainty.\",\r\n  \"map_view_box\": [\r\n    797,\r\n    275,\r\n    33,\r\n    33\r\n  ],\r\n  \"endpoint_labels\": [\r\n    \"Ibiza approach gate\",\r\n    \"N Menorca offshore gate\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"figure_source_label\": \"Garcia-Ladona et al. (1996); regional context\",\r\n  \"route_extent_kind\": \"Balearic island-margin corridor\",\r\n  \"context_landmarks\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"label\": \"Ibiza\",\r\n      \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n        1.45,\r\n        38.98\r\n      ]\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"label\": \"Mallorca\",\r\n      \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n        2.95,\r\n        39.6\r\n      ]\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"label\": \"Menorca\",\r\n      \"coordinates_lon_lat\": [\r\n        4.1,\r\n        39.95\r\n      ]\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"input_sha256\": \"678b8e3c7aa192d6995ffbc4edaa8ab46d88a60b6b6586850b1d919cf2ac0939\",\r\n  \"generator_file\": \"analysis/build_current_reference_path_candidate.py\",\r\n  \"generator_sha256\": \"1362693ec7075e014d065691923248db455a5c3cd78c9a94880b3b472594d240\",\r\n  \"method\": \"Sum shortest WGS84 geodesic distances between successive OSW editorial vertices; no velocity field or current core is reconstructed.\",\r\n  \"nominal_reference_path_km\": 372.752,\r\n  \"reported_approximate_reference_path_km\": 400,\r\n  \"scenario_range_km\": [\r\n    305.222,\r\n    377.458\r\n  ],\r\n  \"reported_scenario_range_km\": [\r\n    300,\r\n    400\r\n  ],\r\n  \"scenario_count\": 54,\r\n  \"scenarios\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"route_variant_id\": \"nominal\",\r\n      \"longitude_offset_degrees\": -0.05,\r\n      \"start_latitude_offset_degrees\": -0.05,\r\n      \"end_latitude_offset_degrees\": -0.05,\r\n      \"start_longitude_offset_degrees\": 0,\r\n      \"end_longitude_offset_degrees\": 