span transcribed; section limits recorded from prose. No source figure digitized or inferred axis width calculated.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Review section boundary, vertical support and figure-caption date discrepancy.\",\r\n        \"Obtain repeated seasonal sections before annual variability or representative width.\",\r\n        \"Canonical measurement admission and release review.\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"phase_label\": \"26 Oct–1 Nov 2009 section\",\r\n      \"source_quality_note\": \"Figure 1 caption says fall 2010, whereas abstract/data text specifies 2009 and detailed station occupation 26 Oct-1 Nov 2009. Follow explicit data text and retain discrepancy pending review.\",\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"dated_section\",\r\n      \"observed_period\": {\r\n        \"start\": \"2009-10-26\",\r\n        \"end\": \"2009-11-01\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"mediterranean-undercurrent-mean-offshore-span\",\r\n      \"current_id\": \"mediterranean-undercurrent\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Mediterranean Undercurrent\",\r\n      \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\r\n      \"measurement_type\": \"published_ensemble_one_sided_span\",\r\n      \"width_metric\": \"core_to_offshore_zero_crossing\",\r\n      \"approximate_width_km\": 30,\r\n      \"width_range_km\": null,\r\n      \"range_interpretation\": \"No source-supplied width uncertainty. These different metrics and sampling supports do not establish a seasonal 10-30 km range.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"Southern Portuguese slope, Region 1 of Figures 6-7; not the entire undercurrent.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"Mean zonal velocity versus meridional distance from 36.8 N, binned at 10 km.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Nonmeddy lower-core RAFOS observations restricted to 950-1250 dbar.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"AMUSE ensemble; floats deployed May 1993-March 1994 and tracked up to 11 months. Launch dates are not observation end dates or an annual climatology.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Mean velocity maximum to offshore zero crossing only. Inshore fall to zero is not robust in the source; do not interpret as full paired-boundary width or double the value.\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1029/2001JC001007\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Bower, Serra and Ambar (2002), Structure of the Mediterranean Undercurrent and Mediterranean Water spreading around the southwestern Iberian Peninsula, doi:10.1029/2001JC001007.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Section 2 [7]; Section 3.2 [19]-[21] and Figure 7a.\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-03\",\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"published_observational_analysis\",\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"Approximate prose value transcribed with its detailed boundary definition; no figure digitized.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Review boundary definition and regional/layer sampling.\",\r\n        \"Obtain comparable repeated observations before seasonal animation or annual range.\",\r\n        \"Canonical measurement admission and release review.\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"phase_label\": \"AMUSE ensemble: offshore span\",\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"ensemble_summary\",\r\n      \"observed_period\": null,\r\n      \"full_width_inference_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"width_metric_label\": \"one-sided core-to-offshore-edge span\",\r\n      \"boundary_sides\": \"one_sided\",\r\n      \"source_quality_note\": \"Reported 0.1 m/s standard deviation describes velocity variability, not width uncertainty.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"mediterranean-undercurrent-1993-section-band\",\r\n      \"current_id\": \"mediterranean-undercurrent\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Mediterranean Undercurrent\",\r\n      \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\r\n      \"measurement_type\": \"published_synoptic_flow_band\",\r\n      \"width_metric\": \"geostrophic_downstream_flow_band\",\r\n      \"approximate_width_km\": 10,\r\n      \"width_range_km\": null,\r\n      \"range_interpretation\": \"No source-supplied width uncertainty. These different metrics and sampling supports do not establish a seasonal 10-30 km range.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"Portimao Canyon section 3 near 8.5 W; not the whole southern Portuguese slope.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"Source hydrographic section across the slope; exact endpoints not digitized.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Narrow downstream geostrophic velocity band centered about 1100 m; not every depth.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"May 1993 AMUSE Oceanus hydrographic survey; exact section occupation day unavailable here. Not a spring climatology.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Source-reported approximately 10 km downstream flow band. Geostrophic velocity referenced to salinity minimum as level of no motion; no new universal threshold inferred.\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1029/2001JC001007\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Bower, Serra and Ambar (2002), Structure of the Mediterranean Undercurrent and Mediterranean Water spreading around the southwestern Iberian Peninsula, doi:10.1029/2001JC001007.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Section 2 [9]; Section 3.1 [16]-[18], Figure 5 caption and section 3.\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-03\",\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"published_observational_analysis\",\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"Approximate prose value transcribed with its detailed boundary definition; no figure digitized.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Review boundary definition and regional/layer sampling.\",\r\n        \"Obtain comparable repeated observations before seasonal animation or annual range.\",\r\n        \"Canonical measurement admission and release review.\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"phase_label\": \"May 1993: Portimao section\",\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"survey_summary\",\r\n      \"observed_period\": null,\r\n      \"full_width_inference_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"width_metric_label\": \"synoptic geostrophic flow-band width\",\r\n      \"boundary_sides\": \"source_reported_band\",\r\n      \"source_quality_note\": \"A synoptic geostrophic band and an ensemble core-to-offshore-edge span use different methods and boundaries.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"davidson-historical-winter-width\",\r\n      \"current_id\": \"davidson\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Davidson Current\",\r\n      \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\r\n      \"measurement_type\": \"published_regional_seasonal_summary\",\r\n      \"width_metric\": \"author_reported_current_width\",\r\n      \"approximate_width_km\": 64,\r\n      \"width_range_km\": null,\r\n      \"range_interpretation\": \"One approximate historical regional value; no numerical uncertainty, repeated seasonal widths or annual extrema supplied.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"California and Oregon coastal strip described by the 1978 report. Possible penetration into Vancouver Island waters is conditional and does not extend this width assignment.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"Not specified in this regional synthesis; no flow-normal section reconstructed.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Seasonal surface current; distinct from the separately described California Undercurrent below 200 m.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"October-March regional seasonal description in a February 1978 report; strongest flow described in January. Not a dated width survey, current-year observation or modern monthly climatology.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Author-reported approximate width; paired boundary coordinates, velocity threshold and sampling method are not specified.\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://waves-vagues.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/library-bibliotheque/40591190_v2.pdf\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Fisheries and Environment Canada, Working Group on West Coast Deepwater Oil Ports (1978), Potential Pacific Coast Oil Ports: A Comparative Environmental Risk Analysis, Volume II - Supplementary Appendices, February 1978.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Appendix II, section II.1, printed II-1 to II-2 (PDF pages 12-13), paragraph beginning The Davidson current; width and months on PDF page 13.\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-03\",\r\n      \"source_publication_year\": 1978,\r\n      \"source_document_sha256\": \"ea4f05cbba6f7b955ba26a93359e237dc041f6d3c2dcbb4cc6ea11ce455dd6c6\",\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"published_historical_regional_synthesis\",\r\n      \"historical_summary\": true,\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"Approximate 64 km and October-March interval transcribed from full PDF prose. No figure digitized, route buffered or station distance interpreted as width.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Review underlying observations, width boundaries and historical applicability.\",\r\n        \"Obtain regional repeated seasonal observations before annual variability or modern representative width.\",\r\n        \"Canonical measurement admission and release review.\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"phase_label\": \"October-March (1978 regional summary)\",\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"seasonal_summary\",\r\n      \"observed_period\": null,\r\n      \"calendar_months\": [\r\n        10,\r\n        11,\r\n        12,\r\n        1,\r\n        2,\r\n        3\r\n      ],\r\n      \"calendar_source_locator\": \"Appendix II section II.1, printed II-2 / PDF page 13: October to March along California and Oregon coasts.\",\r\n      \"source_quality_note\": \"Historical regional summary from 1978, not a present-day width measurement. Vancouver Island penetration is conditional; 25 and 50 km off Tofino are observation locations, not width boundaries. The separately described 50 km California Undercurrent is a different layer and current.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"gaspe-regional-typical-width-range\",\r\n      \"current_id\": \"gaspe\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Gaspé Current\",\r\n      \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\r\n      \"measurement_type\": \"published_regional_summary\",\r\n      \"width_metric\": \"author_reported_current_width\",\r\n      \"approximate_width_km\": null,\r\n      \"width_range_km\": [\r\n        10,\r\n        20\r\n      ],\r\n      \"range_kind\": \"reported_typical_regional_width_span\",\r\n      \"is_confidence_interval\": false,\r\n      \"annual_extrema_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"range_interpretation\": \"Source-reported typical regional width span; no single midpoint or representative width selected. Not a confidence interval, matched seasonal pair or annual extrema.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"Gaspe Peninsula coastal jet described in thesis introductory regional synthesis; not a measured uniform width along the estuary-to-Magdalen reference corridor.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"Not specified for this typical regional prose range.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Upper coastal jet, described in the first approximately 40 m; range not assigned to every depth.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"Regional typical-width summary in February 2022 thesis introduction; the adjacent summer maximum-speed clause does not make this a measured summer width range. No matched winter/summer widths or dated survey interval assigned.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Author-reported typical width; no paired boundary coordinates or reproducible velocity threshold supplied for the range.\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://semaphore.uqar.ca/2055/1/Theau_Leclercq_fevrier2022.pdf\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Leclercq, Théau (2022), Observations des remontées et des plongées des eaux en bordure du courant de Gaspé, master's thesis in oceanography, UQAR-ISMER, February 2022.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Printed page 5 / PDF page 21, paragraph on typical width 10-20 km; printed page 14 / PDF page 30, English introduction, width can reach 20 km.\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-03\",\r\n      \"source_publication_year\": 2022,\r\n      \"source_document_sha256\": \"b8244831f7e593b0f5da2861f44658ccc8e9c4822cb9fe3b122e2e1e5654ae25\",\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"published_regional_literature_summary\",\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"Typical 10-20 km range transcribed from full thesis prose, with corroborating English upper-width statement. No figure digitized, midpoint manufactured or route buffered.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Review original observational definitions and temporal/along-route support behind the synthesis.\",\r\n        \"Obtain paired boundaries and compatible repeat sections before seasonal widths, annual ranges or representative width.\",\r\n        \"Canonical measurement admission and release review.\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"phase_label\": \"Regional typical width (2022 synthesis)\",\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"regional_summary\",\r\n      \"observed_period\": null,\r\n      \"calendar_months\": null,\r\n      \"source_quality_note\": \"Literature summary in an observational thesis, not a new dated width measurement from its transects. Exact boundaries and uncertainty remain unspecified.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"north-cape-northern-2007-profile-scale\",\r\n      \"current_id\": \"north-cape\",\r\n      \"name\": \"North Cape Current — Northern branch\",\r\n      \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\r\n      \"measurement_type\": \"published_survey_profile_fit_scale\",\r\n      \"width_metric\": \"gaussian_e_folding_distance_from_profile_center\",\r\n      \"approximate_width_km\": 8,\r\n      \"width_range_km\": null,\r\n      \"range_interpretation\": \"Approximate fitted effective scale; no fit confidence interval or annual variability range supplied.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"Northern branch near the western Hopen Deep / Spitsbergen Bank polar frontal zone, Barents Sea. Not the Central branch or whole North Cape system.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"Distance from frontal-section center across individual crossings; northward geographic velocity component fitted. Exact paired geographic boundaries unresolved.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Composite vertical support unresolved. Fig. 9 specifies a 20–80 m average for LS05; Fig. 10 does not explicitly establish that same fixed layer for all 15 crossings. Instrument generally sampled from about 20 m to 150 m or 15 m above bottom.\",\r\n      \"fixed_layer_bounds_m\": null,\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"15 frontal crossings during summer expeditions in 2007. Paper describes a 29 May–10 June 2007 cruise, but exact composite sampling bounds are unresolved; not a recurring seasonal width.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Source approximates the mean northward velocity profile by V(x)=17 exp(-(x/8)^2), x in km and V in cm/s, and calls 8 km mean effective width. OSW infers center-to-e-folding scale from the equation; no paired-edge full span is admitted.\",\r\n      \"boundary_sides\": \"fitted_center_to_e_folding_distance\",\r\n      \"full_width_inference_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"annual_extrema_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"seasonal_playback_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"is_confidence_interval\": false,\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://physical-oceanography.ru/repository/issues/2017/02/05/20170205.pdf\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Morozov, Pavlov, Pavlova and Fedorov (2017), Polar Frontal Zone of the Barents Sea Western Trough Based on the Direct Measurements in 2007, Physical Oceanography 2, 36–50, doi:10.22449/1573-160X-2017-2-36-50.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Abstract; Introduction pp. 36–37; Instruments p. 37; Stationary currents p. 38; Currents pp. 45–47, Fig. 9 and Fig. 10, especially Gaussian-fit paragraph on p. 47.\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-03\",\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"published_front_centered_velocity_profile_fit\",\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"Transcribed source fit scale and 15-crossing count; metric interpretation inferred algebraically from stated Gaussian equation. No figure digitized or converted full width added.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"survey_profile_composite\",\r\n      \"phase_label\": \"2007 frontal-crossing composite\",\r\n      \"observed_period\": null,\r\n      \"calendar_months\": null,\r\n      \"cruise_context_period\": {\r\n        \"start\": \"2007-05-29\",\r\n        \"end\": \"2007-06-10\"\r\n      },\r\n      \"cruise_context_is_composite_sampling_bounds\": false,\r\n      \"profile_fit\": {\r\n        \"model\": \"gaussian\",\r\n        \"equation\": \"V(x)=A*exp(-(x/a)^2)\",\r\n        \"amplitude\": 17,\r\n        \"velocity_units\": \"cm/s\",\r\n        \"scale_km\": 8,\r\n        \"coordinate_units\": \"km\",\r\n        \"component\": \"northward_geographic_velocity\",\r\n        \"center_definition\": \"frontal_section_center\",\r\n        \"crossing_count\": 15,\r\n        \"parameter_interpretation\": \"center_to_e_folding_distance\",\r\n        \"interpretation_origin\": \"OSW_algebraic_inference_from_source_equation\",\r\n        \"fit_uncertainty_km\": null\r\n      },\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n      