meridional_scale\",\r\n      \"width_metric_label\": \"general 2-degree jet width; shared source summary\",\r\n      \"approximate_width_km\": 220,\r\n      \"width_range_km\": null,\r\n      \"range_interpretation\": \"No uncertainty interval or annual extrema supplied. Core displacement and PV-front width are separate metrics.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"Pacific Tsuchiya jets: regional stream-coordinate ensembles, not a uniform along-route width. General source statement applies to northern and main southern jets; not secondary-branch width.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"Meridional scale; exact section longitude and paired edges not extracted.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Neutral-density-layer zonal-velocity profiles; density of core varies across the basin. No uniform fixed-depth width.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"Historical stream-coordinate ensemble summary; exact width observation dates unresolved, not seasonal climatology.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Positive-to-negative layer-mean zonal velocity where available; subjective minimum when blended. General span is author-reported, not newly diagnosed.\",\r\n      \"boundary_sides\": \"author_reported_general_jet_span\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://journals.ametsoc.org/view/journals/phoc/30/6/1520-0485_2000_030_1172_pescvt_2.0.co_2.xml\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Rowe, Firing and Johnson (2000), Pacific Equatorial Subsurface Countercurrent Velocity, Transport, and Potential Vorticity, JPO 30, 1172-1187.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Section 3b, printed 1179 / PDF index 7; section 2 sampling and boundary methods, printed 1175-1176.\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-04\",\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"published_stream_coordinate_ensemble_summary\",\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"Source 2-degree latitude span transcribed; WGS84 meridional conversion at equator for approximate unit normalization only. No boundary 