ross 2005-2006. Standard deviation 6 km and reported mean confidence allowance +/-2 km are separate statistics; confidence percentage is unresolved. These are not per-year or seasonal extrema.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"HF radar jet-coordinate section at 25.42 N off Miami; not the whole Florida Current.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"Local cross-stream coordinate perpendicular to the detected jet; geographic endpoints not extracted.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"HF radar nominal measurement depth 0.75 m; no fixed vertical layer assigned.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"2005-2006, year precision; jet metrics filtered with a 40 h Hanning window. Monthly graph readings are provided in a separate diagnostic; this record preserves whole-study statistics.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Distance between both jet edges at 50% of the instantaneous core speed in the jet-coordinate downstream velocity profile; author applies a 40 h Hanning temporal filter to the jet metrics.\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/2017JC013286\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Archer, Shay and Johns (2017), JGR Oceans 122, 9189-9208, doi:10.1002/2017JC013286.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Sections 2.2 and 3.4; Table 1 measurement depth; Table 2 width row and note; Figure 9 caption and section 6 item 5.\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-06\",\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"published_hf_radar_jet_width_time_series_statistics\",\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"Transcribed Table 2 width statistics and author-defined threshold/filter; monthly graph values and geographic edges not digitized.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Recover year-specific monthly values and the source within-month variability envelope or original arrays.\",\r\n        \"Recover matched geographic boundary coordinates before physical map animation.\",\r\n        \"Independent scientific admission.\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"phase_label\": \"Local surface jet statistics, 2005-2006\",\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"width_time_series_statistics\",\r\n      \"observed_period\": null,\r\n      \"calendar_months\": null,\r\n      \"fixed_layer_bounds_m\": null,\r\n      \"boundary_sides\": \"paired_half_core_speed_edges\",\r\n      \"full_width_inference_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"annual_extrema_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"seasonal_playback_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"is_confidence_interval\": false,\r\n      \"width_statistics_context\": {\r\n        \"audit_file\": \"research/florida-hf-radar-width-statistics-scope-audit.json\",\r\n        \"audit_sha256\": \"c01d54e0cf90b1335d83710e8c104e36ef532ea3caaebd0b73d78f493554abdc\",\r\n        \"section_latitude_degrees_north\": 25.42,\r\n        \"sample_period_years\": [\r\n          2005,\r\n          2006\r\n        ],\r\n        \"nominal_measurement_depth_m\": 0.75,\r\n        \"native_grid_spacing_km\": 1.2,\r\n        \"native_sampling_interval_minutes\": 20,\r\n        \"diagnostic_time_filter\": \"40 h Hanning window\",\r\n        \"velocity_component\": \"jet_coordinate_downstream_velocity\",\r\n        \"velocity_threshold_fraction\": 0.5,\r\n        \"reported_statistics\": {\r\n          \"mean_km\": 59,\r\n          \"mean_confidence_half_width_km\": 2,\r\n          \"mean_confidence_level_percent\": null,\r\n          \"confidence_method\": \"Student t distribution with effective degrees of freedom based on integral timescale\",\r\n          \"standard_deviation_km\": 6,\r\n          \"minimum_km\": 41,\r\n          \"maximum_km\": 76,\r\n          \"integral_timescale_days\": 16\r\n        },\r\n        \"seasonal_context\": {\r\n          \"source_locator\": \"Section 3.4, Figure 9 caption; section 6 item 5\",\r\n          \"reported_peak_months\": [\r\n            8,\r\n            9\r\n          ],\r\n