offshore distance retained without converting it to paired cross-flow edges.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Surface expression of averaged absolute geostrophic equatorward flow. The 0–1000 m glider velocity reference is not a fixed measurement layer for this extent.\",\r\n      \"fixed_layer_bounds_m\": null,\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"Spatial and temporal mean of glider profiles; campaign context June 2009–July 2014. Exact contributing dates of the Figure 2 mean unresolved.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Author-reported offshore extent of equatorward mean flow, not a diagnosed pair of current boundaries. Figure 2 contours are 0.1 m/s intervals; no numerical extent threshold assigned.\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.soest.hawaii.edu/oceanography/bo/Schonau_etal_TOS2015.pdf\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Schönau et al. (2015), The Mindanao Current: Mean Structure and Connectivity, Oceanography 28(4), 34–45, doi:10.5670/oceanog.2015.79.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Printed p.38 / PDF p.6, Velocity and Transport, glider paragraph and Figure 2a; mean-line sampling described on pp.36–37 / PDF pp.4–5.\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-08\",\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"published_observational_mean_section_description\",\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"250–300 km transcribed from p.38 prose after inspecting Figure 2a; no edge digitization, midpoint or route buffer.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"annual_extrema_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"seasonal_playback_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"full_width_inference_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"is_confidence_interval\": false,\r\n      \"calendar_months\": null,\r\n      \"observed_period\": null,\r\n      \"boundary_sides\": \"author_reported_one_sided_offshore_extent\",\r\n      \"phase_label\": \"glider mean surface offshore extent\",\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"mean_offshore_extent_range\",\r\n      \"remaining