g and visual inspection; numeric methods read. No new inversion or geographic edge digitization.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"annual_extrema_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"seasonal_playback_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"full_width_inference_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"calendar_months\": null,\r\n      \"observed_period\": null,\r\n      \"phase_label\": \"Section C / tube 2 / August 2015 snapshot\",\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"synoptic_stream_tube_section\",\r\n      \"source_current_label\": \"West Spitsbergen Current; locally constrained stream tube\",\r\n      \"boundary_sides\": \"paired_along_section_stream_tube_limits\",\r\n      \"source_quality_note\": \"Original Table 2 and methods inspected. Brackets are threshold sensitivity; exact occupation dates and geographic width edges are unextracted. A1/A2 share one source tube.\",\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Independent scientific admission and identity review.\",\r\n        \"Recover exact section dates and geographic edge coordinates before mapped width or state intersection.\",\r\n        \"Obtain compatible repeated observations before seasonal or annual dimensions.\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"stream_tube_context\": {\r\n        \"section_id\": \"C\",\r\n        \"stream_tube\": 2,\r\n        \"threshold_velocity_m_s\": null,\r\n        \"threshold_sensitivity_cases\": [],\r\n        \"constraint_transport_sv\": 1.3,\r\n        \"constraint_transport_tolerance_fraction\": 0.1,\r\n        \"transport_tolerance_is_width_error\": false,\r\n        \"offshore_core_relative_edge_km\": null,\r\n        \"section_c_offshore_edge_from_SADCP\": false,\r\n        \"section_b_tube2_shelf_limited\": false,\r\n        \"shared_observation_group\": null,\r\n        \"cruise_context_period\": {\r\n          \"start\": \"2015-08-12\",\r\n          \"end\": \"2015-08-21\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"cruise_period_is_section_sampling_period\": false,\r\n        \"AW_observed_depth_context_m\": [\r\n          45,\r\n          475\r\n        ],\r\n        \"AW_depth_context_is_fixed_width_layer\": false,\r\n        \"geostrophic_reference_pressure_dbar\": 100,\r\n        \"reference_pressure_is_width_depth\": false,\r\n        \"comparison_velocity_depth_context_m\": [\r\n          50,\r\n          500\r\n        ],\r\n        \"comparison_depth_is_width_layer\": false,\r\n        \"grid_horizontal_km\": 1,\r\n        \"grid_vertical_m\": 2,\r\n        \"smoothing_horizontal_km\": 10,\r\n        \"smoothing_vertical_m\": 10,\r\n        \"study_along_isobath_coordinate_km\": 0,\r\n        \"study_coordinate_is_whole_current_length\": false,\r\n        \"boundary_coordinates_extracted\": false,\r\n        \"protocol_file\": \"plans/west-spitsbergen-stream-tube-width-protocol-v1.md\",\r\n        \"protocol_sha256\": \"444d500d47552dcb9482383146e827230a27340178eb465cd96e8e9940861290\",\r\n        \"audit_file\": \"research/west-spitsbergen-kolas-2018-stream-tube-width-scope-audit.json\",\r\n        \"audit_sha256\": \"cb35ac68f45f3d1697583f129c4eb16156803c333d319eb724f60a8ca0083075\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"california-2011-abstract-regional-width\",\r\n      \"current_id\": \"california\",\r\n      \"name\": \"California Current\",\r\n      \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\r\n      \"measurement_type\": \"published_regional_summary\",\r\n      \"width_metric\": \"author_reported_current_width\",\r\n      \"approximate_width_km\": null,\r\n      \"width_range_km\": [\r\n        500,\r\n        800\r\n      ],\r\n      \"range_interpretation\": \"Reported regional width span; no midpoint, confidence interval or annual extrema inferred.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"California Current regional description along the coast from 43 N to 23 N; not a narrow coastal jet, the undercurrent or an individual filament.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"No reproducible section endpoints extracted from the abstract.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Argo and high-resolution XBT synthesis; no fixed measurement layer for the width extracted from the abstract.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"Abstract dataset context: Argo 2004-2010; Honolulu-San Francisco XBT 1991-2010; Honolulu-Los Angeles XBT 2008-2010. These are dataset periods, not exact width occupations or an annual width series.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Author-reported regional width span; paired geographic edges and the diagnostic boundary convention remain unextracted from the full methods.\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0079661111001157\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Auad, G., Roemmich, D. and Gilson, J. (2011), The California Current System in relation to the Northeast Pacific Ocean circulation, Progress in Oceanography 91(4), 576-592, doi:10.1016/j.pocean.2011.09.004.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Publisher abstract, regional current-width sentence.\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-08\",\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"published_publisher_abstract\",\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"Transcribed publisher abstract numerical description; full original methods and figures not inspected.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"full_width_inference_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"annual_extrema_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"seasonal_playback_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"is_confidence_interval\": false,\r\n      \"phase_label\": \"Publisher abstract regional description\",\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"regional_summary\",\r\n      \"observed_period\": null,\r\n      \"calendar_months\": null,\r\n      \"fixed_layer_bounds_m\": null,\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Inspect full original methods and figures to recover the width convention, layer and spatial support.\",\r\n     