OBEC width calculation. Underlying cited boundary method and attribution remain unreviewed.\",\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Resolve the cited original width support and paired boundary method.\",\r\n        \"Obtain compatible repeat sections before monthly or annual variation.\",\r\n        \"Independent scientific admission.\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"original_regional_context\": {\r\n        \"width_passage_visually_inspected\": true,\r\n        \"underlying_width_source\": \"Reed and Schumacher (1986) at the end of the sentence on p50; application to the Alaska breadth is not independently resolved.\",\r\n        \"underlying_width_methods_reviewed\": false,\r\n        \"survey_years_are_width_occupations\": false,\r\n        \"drifter_depth_is_width_layer\": false,\r\n        \"forcing_climatologies_are_width_climatology\": false,\r\n        \"year_round_persistence_is_monthly_width_series\": false,\r\n        \"alaskan_stream_width_is_range_endpoint\": false,\r\n        \"coastal_confinement_is_alaska_width\": false,\r\n        \"shelf_breadth_is_current_width\": false,\r\n        \"boundary_coordinates_extracted\": false,\r\n        \"protocol_file\": \"plans/alaska-regional-width-protocol-v1.md\",\r\n        \"protocol_sha256\": \"21c30fc5f5de4b01ca8ff53e2ac382b2e55052a38618a935669b3729b460b553\",\r\n        \"display_caption\": \"Eastern Gulf of Alaska boundary current · one approximate 300 km regional background description. Numerical uncertainty, width range, fixed layer and observation dates unknown. GLOBEC survey dates, drifter depth and forcing climatologies do not define this width. No annual range, monthly samples or mapped edges inferred.\",\r\n        \"display_method_note\": \"Publisher p49 and its p50 sentence continuation inspected. The narrower Alaskan Stream and inner-shelf Alaska Coastal Current are separate features. The cited original boundary method remains unreviewed.\",\r\n        \"audit_file\": \"research/alaska-weingartner-2002-regional-width-scope-audit.json\",\r\n        \"audit_sha256\": \"475b2cbc7c21e6aac907e2a61153b50088fb77010053f0957e6f2cf44f5535ad\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"pacific-euc-wang-2022-background-width\",\r\n      \"current_id\": \"pacific-equatorial-undercurrent\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Pacific Equatorial Undercurrent\",\r\n      \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\r\n      \"measurement_type\": \"published_regional_summary\",\r\n      \"width_metric\": \"author_reported_current_width\",\r\n      \"approximate_width_km\": 400,\r\n      \"width_range_km\": null,\r\n      \"range_kind\": \"approximate_regional_point_no_reported_interval\",\r\n      \"range_interpretation\": \"One approximate regional background value; no numerical uncertainty, range, confidence interval, annual extrema or seasonal observations supplied.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"Pacific eastward equatorial subsurface jet; background approximation without a fixed section longitude or paired edge coordinates. Not the generic cross-basin family or Atlantic/Indian EUC.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"No reproducible transverse section endpoints supplied for the regional breadth description.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Subsurface current background; adjacent approximate thickness and 50–200 m core depths are context, not a fixed width measurement layer.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"Background synthesis in a 2022 article; no dated width occupation or monthly width climatology. Simulation years and transport/velocity climatologies have different support.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Author-reported approximate background width. No velocity cutoff, paired boundaries or explicit transverse section extracted. Model transport boxes are not width boundaries.\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/marine-science/articles/10.3389/fmars.2022.908939/full\",\r\n      \"source_citat