idths. No annual range or mapped edges inferred.\",\r\n        \"display_method_note\": \"Publisher p1 width prose and p4 transport context inspected. About 200 m thickness and 50–200 m core depths are separate descriptions. The 3°S–3°N transport box is not a width observation. Historical boundary method remains unreviewed; no transfer to other basin currents.\",\r\n        \"audit_file\": \"research/pacific-euc-wang-2022-background-width-scope-audit.json\",\r\n        \"audit_sha256\": \"9be49243e762e82c9a7ce0e0348a3a8e29c4c8973b34f4773a4ebdb49799c998\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"atlantic-euc-gouriou-1988-background-width\",\r\n      \"current_id\": \"atlantic-equatorial-undercurrent\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Atlantic Equatorial Undercurrent\",\r\n      \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\r\n      \"measurement_type\": \"published_regional_summary\",\r\n      \"width_metric\": \"author_reported_current_width\",\r\n      \"approximate_width_km\": 200,\r\n      \"width_range_km\": null,\r\n      \"range_kind\": \"approximate_regional_point_no_reported_interval\",\r\n      \"range_interpretation\": \"One approximate regional background value; no numerical uncertainty, range, confidence interval, annual extrema or seasonal observations supplied.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"Atlantic eastward subsurface equatorial jet, called Lomonosov current; Brazil to Gulf of Guinea background description without paired boundary coordinates or a specified transverse section.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"No reproducible transverse section endpoints supplied for the regional breadth description.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Subsurface current background. Adjacent 150 m thickness and 50–125 m core depths do not define a fixed width measurement layer.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"1988 French synthesis; no dated width occupation. Compilation years, dated example sections and transport occupations are separate supports.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Approximate author-reported background width; no paired edges or boundary threshold directly resolved. Transport cutoff is not adopted as this width method.\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://horizon.documentation.ird.fr/exl-doc/pleins_textes/divers11-10/34183.pdf\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Y. Gouriou (1988), chapter III, section 3.3.2, printed p16, in Fonteneau and Marcille (eds.), FAO Fisheries Technical Paper 292 (French edition), ISBN 92-5-202652-5.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Printed p16 / PDF page 31, section 3.3.2; title/copyright PDF pages 2–3; Figure 3.4 printed p18 / PDF page 33.\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-08\",\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"published_original_regional_background_synthesis\",\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"Approximate breadth transcribed from visually inspected institutional original; no contour, transport or coordinate digitization.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"full_width_inference_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"annual_extrema_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"seasonal_playback_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"is_confidence_interval\": false,\r\n      \"phase_label\": \"Atlantic subsurface jet background synthesis\",\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"regional_summary\",\r\n      \"observed_period\": null,\r\n      \"calendar_months\": null,\r\n      \"fixed_layer_bounds_m\": null,\r\n      \"uncertainty_km\": null,\r\n      \"source_quality_note\": \"Original French volume confirms 200 km prose. Exact historical paired-boundary support remains unresolved. The later English OCR version and dated Voituriez sections are not independent 200 km width observations.\",\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Resolve historical background-width boundary method and exact attribution.\",\r\n        \"Extract compatible repeated transverse sections before seasonal dimensions.