width dates, paired edges and numerical uncertainty remain unknown.\",\r\n        \"display_aria_label\": \"Lancaster intrusion average width: 10-30 km reported average regional width span. Intrusion into and out of eastern Lancaster Sound; external editorial route omits this excursion. No annual range or mapped width edges. Both summers had unusually severe sea ice.\",\r\n        \"audit_file\": \"research/baffin-fissel-1982-regional-width-scope-audit.json\",\r\n        \"audit_sha256\": \"5e724cd74f258b8e718caac10b168e0861c3950e93e2ee077df0c8983d8c9b8a\",\r\n        \"audit_pointer\": \"/measurements/1\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"western-adriatic-chavanne-2007-ravenna-mean-width\",\r\n      \"current_id\": \"western-adriatic\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Western Adriatic Current\",\r\n      \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\r\n      \"measurement_type\": \"published_regional_summary\",\r\n      \"width_metric\": \"author_reported_current_width\",\r\n      \"approximate_width_km\": 40,\r\n      \"width_range_km\": null,\r\n      \"range_kind\": \"approximate_regional_point_no_reported_interval\",\r\n      \"range_interpretation\": \"One local width reported from a mean surface-flow profile. Two locations are not a seasonal/annual interval, numerical uncertainty or confidence interval.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"Cross-shore mean profile off Ravenna, northwestern Adriatic; section AA-prime in Figures 13-14.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"Source cross-shore transect; exact geographic endpoint coordinates not extracted.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Radar surface flow; approximately 1 m effective measurement depth is not a fixed-depth slab.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"Deployment October 2002 to October 2004; source calls profiles two-year means. Site-specific coverage and gaps differ, with exact averaging weights and valid width timestamps unresolved.\",\r\n      \"boundar