land\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Jutland Current\",\r\n      \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\r\n      \"measurement_type\": \"published_regional_summary\",\r\n      \"width_metric\": \"author_reported_current_width\",\r\n      \"approximate_width_km\": 25,\r\n      \"width_range_km\": null,\r\n      \"range_kind\": \"reported_typical_regional_width_span\",\r\n      \"range_interpretation\": \"One site-specific width description attributed to satellite imagery. Not a dated image diagnosis, paired velocity width, confidence interval, annual extrema or range across sites; no midpoint selected.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"Off Hanstholm, Jutland Coastal Current, eastern North Sea / Skagerrak; geographic section coordinates not extracted.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"Reported satellite-image current breadth at a named coastal site; no flow-normal transect orientation recovered.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Satellite-image description; measurement depth not recovered. Mixed-water and local bathymetry context do not fix a width layer.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"Undated image-derived estimate summarized in the April 1999 thesis reprinted October 2000, citing Aarup 1994a. Publication and hydrographic-study years are not width occupation dates.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Author-reported width attributed to satellite imagery; image classification threshold, sensor and exact edge rule not recovered.\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.dmi.dk/fileadmin/Rapporter/SR/sr00-15.pdf\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Nielsen, Mads Hvid (2000), Dynamisk beskrivelse og hydrografisk klassifikation af Den Jyske Kyststrom, DMI Scientific Report 00-15, ISBN 87-7478-425-0. Reprint of April 1999 University of Copenhagen master thesis; reprint preface October 2000.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Section 2.4 / 2.4.1, printed p14 / PDF p22; mixed-water context printed p15 / PDF p23; qualitative wideni