South Atlantic Current, Journal of Physical Oceanography20,846-859.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Original p854 right column; Table1(k) p851, Table2(k) p853, Figure5/caption p855.\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-17\",\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"published_original_scan_reviewed_local_subcomponent_band_breadth\",\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"Visual original page review; nominal breadth transcribed. No source curve, flow boundary or uncertainty digitized.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"full_width_inference_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"annual_extrema_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"seasonal_playback_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"is_confidence_interval\": false,\r\n      \"phase_label\": \"Southern component band / October 1983\",\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"month_dated_subcomponent_band_breadth\",\r\n      \"observed_period\": null,\r\n      \"observed_month\": \"1983-10\",\r\n      \"time_precision\": \"month\",\r\n      \"calendar_months\": null,\r\n      \"fixed_layer_bounds_m\": null,\r\n      \"uncertainty_km\": null,\r\n      \"source_quality_note\": \"One historical band component; primary front carries additional SAC flow. Total-current breadth and secondary-core diameter remain unresolved.\",\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Recover paired geographic width edges and explicit boundary criterion.\",\r\n        \"Recover exact width evaluation depth and occupation days.\",\r\n        \"Acquire compatible repeated same-component sections before annual or seasonal comparison.\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"original_regional_context\": {\r\n        \"description_kind\": \"historical_sac_southern_component_band\",\r\n        \"source_section\": \"k / Knorr Ajax Cruise Leg1\",\r\n        \"observed_month\": \"1983-10\",\r\n        \"component_role\": \"Southern SAC transport band south of the primary surface Subtropical Front; excludes the primary-front con