ent northern-branch geometry, upstream NBC retroflection, equatorial ESC and eastern-basin continuation. Not a whole-current length or sum of branches. All latitude gates and bends are editorial.\"\r\n        }\r\n      ],\r\n      \"state_evidence\": [],\r\n      \"connections\": [],\r\n      \"scope_notes\": [\r\n        {\r\n          \"current_id\": \"atlantic-north-equatorial-countercurrent\",\r\n          \"label\": \"Western summer reach versus mean section bands\",\r\n          \"audit_file\": \"research/atlantic-necc-western-summer-branch-width-scope-audit.json\",\r\n          \"summary\": \"Western summer studied reach retains branch-merging limits and editorial latitude gates. Source mean-field widths at two sections are not the selected route width, seasonal range or mean of instantaneous widths. Whole-current and annual dimensions unresolved.\",\r\n          \"source_url\": \"https://os.copernicus.org/articles/19/251/2023/os-19-251-2023.html\",\r\n          \"source_locator\": \"Sections 2.1, 3, 4.2 and 6 / Fig. 8 caption\",\r\n          \"observed_period\": null\r\n        }\r\n      ],\r\n      \"evidence_links\": [],\r\n      \"object_url\": \"object.html?id=current%3Aatlantic-north-equatorial-countercurrent\",\r\n      \"route_url\": \"reference-routes.html#atlantic-necc-western-summer-reference-path-candidate\",\r\n      \"season_url\": \"seasons.html?current=atlantic-north-equatorial-countercurrent\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"current:atlantic-north-equatorial-undercurrent\",\r\n      \"label\": \"Atlantic North Equatorial Undercurrent\",\r\n      \"type\": \"named_current\",\r\n      \"identity_level\": \"current\",\r\n      \"source_kind\": \"eastward subsurface jet\",\r\n      \"setting\": \"equatorial\",\r\n      \"time_behavior\": \"persistent_variable\",\r\n      \"basin\": \"Tropical Atlantic\",\r\n      \"capabilities\": {\r\n        \"observed_velocity\": 0,\r\n        \"radius_evidence\": 0,\r\n        \"reported_length\": 0,\