udes surface drift and recirculation loops. The eastern fate and whole-current dimensions are unresolved; 3â€“6 S sampling band is not width.\",\r\n          \"source_url\": \"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1029/2008GL035753\",\r\n          \"source_locator\": \"Section 2 [6]â€“[7] and Fig. 1: floats parked at 200 m; 174 ten-day zonal-flow estimates within 3â€“6 S, 35 W to approximately 10 W. Section 4 [9]: mean core around 3 S at 35 W and slightly south of 4 S farther east. Sections 5â€“6: western meanders and unresolved layer-dependent connectivity.\",\r\n          \"observed_period\": null\r\n        }\r\n      ],\r\n      \"evidence_links\": [],\r\n      \"object_url\": \"object.html?id=current%3Aatlantic-south-equatorial-undercurrent\",\r\n      \"route_url\": \"reference-routes.html#atlantic-seuc-reach-reference-path-candidate\",\r\n      \"season_url\": \"seasons.html?current=atlantic-south-equatorial-undercurrent\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"current:azores-countercurrent\",\r\n      \"label\": \"Azores Countercurrent\",\r\n      \"type\": \"named_current\",\r\n      \"identity_level\": \"current\",\r\n      \"source_kind\": \"subsurface westward countercurrent\",\r\n      \"setting\": \"basin_interior_or_extension\",\r\n      \"time_behavior\": \"unresolved\",\r\n      \"basin\": \"North Atlantic\",\r\n      \"capabilities\": {\r\n        \"observed_velocity\": 0,\r\n        \"radius_evidence\": 0,\r\n        \"reported_length\": 0,\r\n        \"reference_route\": 0,\r\n        \"scoped_width\": 1,\r\n        \"geometry\": 0,\r\n        \"time_samples\": 1,\r\n        \"source_connectivity\": 0,\r\n        \"scope_notes\": 0,\r\n        \"dated_diagnostics\": 0,\r\n        \"flow_network\": 0,\r\n        \"passage_transport\": 0\r\n      },\r\n      \"recorded_claims\": 59,\r\n      \"nasa_links\": 1,\r\n      \"fingerprint\": \"c1ebe3dc2e34853c98b15c328bd980c6ae110903b3d64011613bf50f95380d93\",\r\n      \"series\": [],\r\n   