44.1\r\n              ],\r\n              [\r\n                8.45,\r\n                43.9\r\n              ],\r\n              [\r\n                8.05,\r\n                43.7\r\n              ],\r\n              [\r\n                7.65,\r\n                43.55\r\n              ],\r\n              [\r\n                7.35,\r\n                43.5\r\n              ]\r\n            ]\r\n          },\r\n          \"role\": \"editorial_reference_route\",\r\n          \"note\": \"Declared coastal studied reach of the Northern Current from an OSW offshore Genoa neighborhood gate through the Imperia sector to an OSW Menton–Nice neighborhood gate. Ligurian is retained as the ledger regional segment classification, not a separate additive current system. Excludes Corsica feeder routes, basin-wide drifter loops and downstream Provencal/Catalan continuation. Gates are not whole-current endpoints.\"\r\n        }\r\n      ],\r\n      \"state_evidence\": [],\r\n      \"connections\": [],\r\n      \"scope_notes\": [\r\n        {\r\n          \"current_id\": \"ligurian\",\r\n          \"label\": \"Ligurian studied segment within Northern Current\",\r\n          \"audit_file\": \"research/ligurian-northern-segment-scope-audit.json\",\r\n          \"summary\": \"The ledger treats Ligurian Current as a Northern Current segment. This studied reach overlaps the broader current geography; do not add its length to the parent or count it as an independent parallel flow. Surface sampled Genoaâ€“Menton/Nice reach retains editorial gates. Local 15â€“35 km offshore profile band supplies approximately 20 km span; no whole-current or seasonal width inferred.\",\r\n          \"source_url\": \"https://mrea.sincem.unibo.it/images/reports/2011_Poulain_Aspects_of_the_surface_circulation.pdf\",\r\n          \"source_locator\": \"Poulain et al. (2012), Introduction pp. 261â€“263: NC formation and Italian/French coastal continuation; sections 2.1 and 4, pp. 264â€“266 and 274â€“276: surface sampling, Genoa, Imperia, Mentonâ€“Nice and current structure.\",\r\n          \"observed_period\": null\r\n        }\r\n      ],\r\n      \"evidence_links\": [],\r\n      \"object_url\": \"object.html?id=current%3Aligurian\",\r\n      \"route_url\": \"reference-routes.html#ligurian-reach-reference-path-candidate\",\r\n      \"season_url\": \"seasons.html?current=ligurian\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"current:loop\",\r\n      \"label\": \"Loop Current\",\r\n      \"type\": \"named_current\",\r\n      \"identity_level\": \"segment\",\r\n      \"source_kind\": \"western boundary current segment\",\r\n      \"setting\": \"western_boundary\",\r\n      \"time_behavior\": \"persistent_variable\",\r\n      \"basin\": \"Gulf of Mexico\",\r\n      \"capabilities\": {\r\n        \"observed_velocity\": 0,\r\n        \"radius_evidence\": 0,\r\n        \"reported_length\": 0,\r\n        \"reference_route\": 0,\r\n        \"scoped_width\": 3,\r\n        \"geometry\": 0,\r\n        \"time_samples\": 10,\r\n        \"source_connectivity\": 0,\r\n        \"scope_notes\": 2,\r\n        \"dated_diagnostics\": 10,\r\n        \"flow_network\": 0,\r\n        \"passage_transport\": 0\r\n      },\r\n      \"recorded_claims\": 56,\r\n      \"nasa_links\": 1,\r\n      \"fingerprint\": \"64da5ee4dbedc594889a527869ec03c6683fdba64fdc67fbb0e79aa4cc6cf907\",\r\n      \"series\": [\r\n        {\r\n          \"label\": \"Yucatan inflow section spans — NOAA\",\r\n          \"url\": \"query.html?q=%7B%22collection%22%3A%22width_samples%22%2C%22filters%22%3A%5B%7B%22field%22%3A%22diagnostic_id%22%2C%22op%22%3A%22eq%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22diagnostic%3Ayucatan-noaa-sections%22%7D%5D%2C%22limit%22%3A50%7D\",\r\n          \"frames\": 5,\r\n          \"evidence_role\": \"local_component_section_span_not_whole_current_width\"\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n          \"label\": \"Yucatan inflow section spans — ADT\",\r\n          \"url\": \"query.html?q=%7B%22collection%22%3A%22width_samples%22%2C%22filt