her observed cores nor endpoints or length measurements. Multi-basin family names have one point per basin and must be split into separate records before quantitative comparison.\"\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n          \"geometry\": {\r\n            \"type\": \"LineString\",\r\n            \"coordinates\": [\r\n              [\r\n                77,\r\n                4\r\n              ],\r\n              [\r\n                78.5,\r\n                4\r\n              ],\r\n              [\r\n                80.5,\r\n                4\r\n              ],\r\n              [\r\n                82,\r\n                4.5\r\n              ],\r\n              [\r\n                83,\r\n                6\r\n              ]\r\n            ]\r\n          },\r\n          \"role\": \"editorial_reference_route\",\r\n          \"note\": \"Declared 77–83 E Sri Lanka regional summer reach, oriented eastward. Gates and connecting vertices are selected by OSW; neither gate is a physical whole-current endpoint. Excludes Arabian Sea source branches, Laccadive circulation, Bay of Bengal continuation, equatorial jets and subsurface counterflows. Different seasonal drawings do not diagnose occupied footprints or annual extrema.\"\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n          \"geometry\": {\r\n            \"type\": \"LineString\",\r\n            \"coordinates\": [\r\n              [\r\n                83,\r\n                6\r\n              ],\r\n              [\r\n                82,\r\n                5\r\n              ],\r\n              [\r\n                80.5,\r\n                5\r\n              ],\r\n              [\r\n                78.5,\r\n                5.5\r\n              ],\r\n              [\r\n                77,\r\n                6\r\n              ]\r\n            ]\r\n          },\r\n          \"role\": \"editorial_reference_route\",\r\n          \"note\": \"Declared 77–83 E Sri Lanka regional winter reach, oriented westward. Gates and connecting vertices are 