am East Kamchatka Current, Sea of Okhotsk circuits, offshore return branch into Subarctic Current, eastward Oyashio Extension/front and detached eddies. This branch convention is not the complete Oyashio system.\"\r\n        }\r\n      ],\r\n      \"state_evidence\": [],\r\n      \"connections\": [\r\n        {\r\n          \"id\": \"connection:oyashio-to-aleutian\",\r\n          \"subject_id\": \"current:oyashio\",\r\n          \"object_id\": \"current:aleutian\",\r\n          \"predicate\": \"source_described_feeding_relation\",\r\n          \"status\": \"local_research_candidate_not_canonical\",\r\n          \"source_url\": \"https://glossary.ametsoc.org/wiki/aleutian-current/\",\r\n          \"source_locator\": \"Aleutian Current definition, second paragraph\",\r\n          \"source_access_date\": \"2026-10-03\",\r\n          \"source_read_status\": \"full_page_read\",\r\n          \"scope\": \"AMS describes Oyashio outflow feeding the eastward Aleutian Current.\",\r\n          \"vertical_scope\": \"No fixed depth interval supplied; no quantified cross-layer transfer.\",\r\n          \"time_scope\": \"General glossary convention, not a dated or season-specific flow estimate.\",\r\n          \"junction_coordinate\": null,\r\n          \"transport_sv\": null,\r\n          \"canonical_admission\": false,\r\n          \"diagram_role\": \"schematic_identity_connection_not_measured_flow_path\",\r\n          \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n            \"Review vertical, seasonal and naming conventions against physical observations.\",\r\n            \"Diagnose physical feeding and splitting before any junction coordinates or transport fractions.\",\r\n            \"Do not inherit lengths, widths, footprints or state relations across the link.\"\r\n          ]\r\n        }\r\n      ],\r\n      \"scope_notes\": [],\r\n      \"evidence_links\": [],\r\n      \"object_url\": \"object.html?id=current%3Aoyashio\",\r\n      \"route_url\": \"reference-routes.html#oyashio-reference-pa