soon southward Somali coastal branch from an OSW northern gate at 7 N to an OSW confluence gate at 3 S. Source latitude ranges are 6-8 N for divergence and 2-4 S for confluence with East African Coast Current. Excludes the northward flow north of the divergence, offshore feeder, eastward continuation, undercurrents and gyre circuits. No year-round whole-current extent asserted.\"\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n          \"geometry\": {\r\n            \"type\": \"LineString\",\r\n            \"coordinates\": [\r\n              [\r\n                43.4,\r\n                0\r\n              ],\r\n              [\r\n                44.7,\r\n                1\r\n              ],\r\n              [\r\n                46,\r\n                2\r\n              ],\r\n              [\r\n                47.2,\r\n                3\r\n              ],\r\n              [\r\n                47.7,\r\n                3.5\r\n              ]\r\n            ]\r\n          },\r\n          \"role\": \"editorial_reference_route\",\r\n          \"note\": \"June-July southern Somali coastal limb from an OSW equatorial gate northward to an OSW separation gate at 3.5 N. Source describes offshore departure south of 4 N and limited exchange with the northern Great Whirl. Excludes the upstream East African Coast Current, offshore Southern Gyre return limb, Great Whirl, Socotra outflow and undercurrents. This is one seasonal component, not the full summer Somali Current system.\"\r\n        }\r\n      ],\r\n      \"state_evidence\": [],\r\n      \"connections\": [],\r\n      \"scope_notes\": [],\r\n      \"evidence_links\": [],\r\n      \"object_url\": \"object.html?id=current%3Asomali\",\r\n      \"route_url\": \"reference-routes.html#somali-winter-reference-path-candidate\",\r\n      \"season_url\": \"seasons.html?current=somali\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"current:south-atlantic\",\r\n      \"label\": \"South Atlantic Current\",\r\n      \"type\": \"named_current\",\r\n      \"iden